constexpr std::string_view kHeaderDoc =
    "GameScrcpy native extension interface (ADR-0097, ADR-0112). Generated by gs api write from the script binding "
    "table and the native ABI table; do not edit. Every struct that a DLL fills in, and every struct that holds "
    "arrays, starts with its size: each side reads only the fields that both sides know and takes the others as 0, "
    "so later versions only add fields at the end. Structs marked as never changing are the elements of arrays.";

